Money
	Farming
		Fertilizers
			Speed-Gro
				Source: Pierre's
				Price: 100g
			Deluxe Speed-Gro
				Source: Pierre's
				Price: 150g
				Note: do not craft
			Hyper Speed-Gro
				1 Radioactive Ore
				3 Bone Fragment
					Source: Bone Nodes on Ginger Island Dig Site
				1 Solar Essence

		On Main Farm
			Sow Ancient Fruit
			Fertilize with Hyper Speed-Gro or Speed-Gro (but not with Deluxe Speed-Gro)
			Harvest after⬇️
				25/7 days with Speed-Gro
				18/7 days with Hyper Speed-Gro
			Replant with Fiber Seeds

			On current year
				Any day (once)
					Go to Greenhouse
					Destroy all plants except Ancient Fruits
					Makes watering as efficient as possible (use Pressure Nozzle if possible)
					☣️Fertilize every (or as many as possible) free tile with Hyper Speed-Gro
					Remove all fruit trees
					Remove all chests and save items as currently doing
				Everyday
					Go to Greenhouse
					if Ancient Fruit ready to harvest > 1
						Harvest all Ancient Fruit
						Feed them into the Seed Makers
						Craft as many Seed Makers as needed and place them at the Greenhouse
						if Greenhouse's free tiles > 1
							Plant as many new Ancient Seeds as possible
						Else
							Save Ancient Seeds in seed's chest
			Next Year
				Spring 1st
					Harvest all Fiber
					Sow all Ancient Seeds saved or as many as possible
				On 1st harvest↖️
					Feed all Ancient Fruit harvested into Seed Makers
					At this point, Ancient Fruit plants at the Greenhouse can be destroyed
				On subsequent harvests↖️
					Convert into wine (continues on Winemaking)

			Seeds
				Fiber Seed
					1 Mixed Seed
						Source: Krobus (Thursdays)
						Price: 30g
					5 Sap
					1 Clay
						Source: Clay Nodes at Ginger Island Dig Site

			Equipment
				Seed Maker
					25 Wood
					1 Gold Bar
					10 Coal

		On Island Farm
			Sow Starfruit
			Fertilize with the best fertilizer available
			Harvest after⬇️
				11 days with Speed-Gro (+15%)
				9 days with Deluxe Speed-Gro (+18%)
				8 days with Hyper Speed-Gro (+11%)
			Replant immediately

			On current year
				Any day
					Go to Oasis
					Buy the exact quantity needed of Starfruit Seeds
					Go to Ginger Island Farm
					Tile all tileable cells
					Mark limits
					Fertilize with the best fertilizer available but without mixing fertilizers
					Sow all Starfruit Seeds
					Water all seeds
				On harvest day↖️
					Go to Ginger Island Farm
					Harvest all Starfruits
					Go to Oasis
					Buy the exact quantity needed of Starfruit Seeds
					Go back to Ginger Island Farm
					Sow all Starfruit Seeds
					Convert into wine (continues on Winemaking)

	Winemaking
		Craft as many Kegs as possible
		Place fruit on Keg
		Wait 7 days
		Profit
		Optional
			Use Fairy Dust prioritizing Starfruit Wine
			Equal profit but faster

		Equipment
			Keg
				30 Wood
				1 Copper Bar
				1 Iron Bar
				1 Oak Resin

	Foresting
		Plant as many trees as possible
		Craft a Tree Fertilizer for every tree planted (prioritize Tree Fertilizers for tapping forests)
		if the forest is for tapping
			Craft a Tapper or Heavy Tapper for every tree planted
			Place a Tapper in every tree
			Prioritize Heavy Tappers for Mystic Trees
			Collect product when filled

		Seeds
			Mystic Tree Seed
				5 Acorn
				5 Maple Seed
				5 Pine Cone
				5 Mahogany Seed

		Fertilizer
			Tree Fertilizer
				5 Fiber
				5 Stone

		Equipment
			Tapper
				40 Wood
				2 Copper Bar
			Heavy Tapper
				30 Hardwood
				1 Radioactive Bar

		Wood | Acorn | Maple Seed | Pine Cone
			On free time
				Cut down trees anywhere
				Maybe grow a Pine Forest in Calico Desert

		Hardwood | Mahogany Seeds
			On free time
				Cut down Mahogany Trees on Ginger Island
				Cut down tree stumps on Secret Woods
				For additional Mahogany Seeds, they can be traded by Raccoon's Wife for 20 Coal

		Fairy Dust
			Craft as many Mystic Tree Seeds as possible
			Grow a Mystic Forest
			Collect product after⬇️
				7 days with Tapper
				3 days with Heavy Tapper (+57%)

		Oak Resin
			With the Acorns left, grow an Oak forest
			Collect product after⬇️
				7 days with Tapper
				3 days with Heavy Tapper (+57%)
